  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - GETCO Renewable Power Integration Project, through Government of India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $568,688 technical assistance (TA) grant supports the Gujarat Energy Transmission Corporation Limited (GETCO) Renewable Power Integration project, which concerns the integration of renewable energy sources into GETCO&apos;s transmission system. Using modeling, statistical techniques, and U.S. technologies, the TA is analyzing the utility&apos;s power system and developing mitigation strategies to ensure appropriate load balancing and frequency regulation for GETCO&apos;s transmission operations. The project is expected to serve as a model for integrating a power transmission system with renewable energy resources in the state of Gujarat as well as other regions in India.</narrative>
  </description>
